`s 672.1(1) prescribed` MEANS
    IF `the regulations made by the Governor in Council under section 672.95 prescribe it`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "prescribed means prescribed by regulations made by the Governor in Council under section 672.95"

-- Review Board means the Review Board established or designated for a province pursuant to subsection 672.38(1).
-- src:13328 | Review Board means the Review Board established or designated for a province pursuant to subsection 672.38(1); (commission d’examen)
